@startuml US073_SD
title US073 - Create Flight Route - Sequence Diagram

actor "ATCC" as Collab

participant "CreateFlightRouteUI" as UI
participant "CreateFlightRoute\nController" as Controller
participant "CreateFlightRoute\nService" as Service
participant "FlightRoute" as Route
participant "FlightRouteRepository" as Repo

Collab -> UI : input route and segments data
UI -> UI : build FlightRouteDTO
UI -> Controller : createFlightRoute(dto)
Controller -> Service : createFlightRoute(dto)

note right of Service: Service maps DTOs to Domain Value Objects\n(FlightRouteID, IataCodeAirport, RouteSegment, etc.)

Service -> Route ** : create(routeId, companyCode, origin, dest, segments)
note right of Route: Domain validations are executed\n(e.g., ID format, non-empty segments)

Service -> Repo : save(route)
Repo --> Service : savedRoute
Service --> Controller : savedRoute
Controller --> UI : savedRoute
UI --> Collab : display success message

@enduml